scenario: reset-fails-readonly
A         getSchema() (pgjdbc runs select current_schema())                                            public
A         close()                                                                                      threw SQLException SQLSTATE 25001: Cannot change transaction read-only property in the middle of a transaction.
observer  pool backend after A's close()                                                               state=idle in transaction xact_open=true xid=false xmin=true
B         same physical session as A                                                                   true
B         getAutoCommit() through the pool                                                             false
B         isReadOnly() through the pool                                                                true
B         insert (B expects autocommit)                                                                SQLSTATE 25006: ERROR: cannot execute INSERT in a read-only transaction
observer  where B's insert is visible                                                                  not visible (uncommitted or absent)
B         close()                                                                                      returned normally
observer  pool backend after B's close()                                                               state=idle in transaction (aborted) xact_open=false xid=false xmin=false
